  "long_description": "<style>\r\nspan.disable { color: grey !important; text-decoration: line-through; }\r\n.custom-line { border-bottom: 1px solid grey; padding-bottom: 5px; }\r\n.red { color: red;}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"color:red;\"><strong>This campground is in the Gascoyne Region</strong></h4>\r\n<div>\r\n<img src=\"/media/parkstay/campground_images/25f050a7-6c3.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\"> \r\n</div>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center;\">Five camp sites</h4>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t\t<h5>Sites suitable for</h5>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"\"> </i>Freestanding tents & swags\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"\"> </i>Campervans, rooftop & awning tents\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"\"> </i>Caravans & camper trailers\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"fa fa-warning red\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</i> Camp site surface is compacted. Driving pegs is difficult.\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t\t<h5>Vehicle access</h5>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"\"> </i>2WD access\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"\"> </i>Unsealed roads within the campground\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t<h5>Campfires, pets, generators</h5>\r\n</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</i>Campfires permitted</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t <span class=\"disable\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t <i class=\"\"> </i>Pets permitted</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</i> Generators permitted</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t\t<h5>Facilities</h5>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\"> </i>Drinking water</span>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"\"> </i><em>No-flush</em> pit toilets\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\"> </i>Showers</span>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\"> </i>Dump station</span>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\">  </i>Picnic tables</span>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\"> </i>Gas barbecues</span>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\"> </i>Dishwashing</span>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"disable\"><i class=\"\"> </i>Powered sites</span>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t\t<h5>Fees</h5>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tCamping fee: per person, per night camping fee indicated below. Pay in full to complete your booking.\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>Park entry fee: per vehicle. Pay when booking or purchase a  <a href=\"https://shop.dbca.wa.gov.au\"> park pass</a> separately.</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://exploreparks.dbca.wa.gov.au/know/fees\">More about fees</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t\t<h5>Booking</h5>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tChoose your camp site when you book: <a href=\"/media/parkstay/campground_maps/20/Bungarra_Campground_mud_map.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">view the campground plan</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tBook up to 180 days before arrival.\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tOne site only per booking. Booking must be in the name of a person who will occupy the site.\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tMaximum stay in Cape Range National Park: 14 nights in any 42 night period if <em>any</em> night booked is during <a href=\"https://www.education.wa.edu.au/\">Western Australia public school holidays</a>, 28 nights in any 42 night period at any other time.\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tEducation and tour operator groups cannot be booked online: <a href=\"https://exploreparks.dbca.wa.gov.au/park-stay-enquiry-cape-range-national-park\">make an enquiry</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t\t<h5>Changes, cancellation, refund</h5>\r\n    </div>\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"fa fa-warning red\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</i> Changes not permitted. Notify us if you will not occupy the camp site for any night of your booking or it may be cancelled.\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\tCancel up to 29 days before arrival for 50% refund.\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://exploreparks.dbca.wa.gov.au/know/online-camp-site-booking-terms-and-conditions\">Full terms and conditions</a>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t\t<h5>Arrival and departure</h5>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tSet up camp from 10am. Vacate site by 10am\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\" >\r\n\t\t<h5>Location</h5>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"col-md-9\" >\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t79km from Exmouth via Murat Road and Yardie Creek Road.\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n\t\t\t<h5>The park</h5>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-9\">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRead more about <a href=\"https://exploreparks.dbca.wa.gov.au/park/cape-range\">Cape Range National Park</a> and <i class=\"fa fa-warning red\"> </i> check <a href=\"https://alerts.dbca.wa.gov.au\">Parks and Wildlife alerts</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n<hr>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\r\n<h5>Enquiries</h5>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-9\">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://exploreparks.dbca.wa.gov.au/park-stay-enquiry-cape-range-national-park\">Contact Milyering Discovery Centre, Cape Range National Park</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n<hr>",
